ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603242357566464_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603242357566464_720.jpg"> </div><p>【萨拉赫宣布将离队】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2da224be27native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">重磅！萨拉赫社媒宣布：我将在本赛季结束后离开利物浦</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/69c2e3ee131e7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/69c2e3ee131e7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/69c2e3ee131e7.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">萨拉赫在社媒发布视频，宣布他将在本赛季结束后离开利物浦。萨拉赫与利物浦的合同在2027年夏天到期。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2df70a42d7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">利物浦官方：萨拉赫与球队达成协议，将结束在安菲尔德的9年生涯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.41" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250305206846.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.41" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.41" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250305206846_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250305206846_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">萨拉赫在社媒发布视频，宣布自己将在赛季末离开利物浦，利物浦官方随后也发布公告证实此消息。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2e135a7fc0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一个时代结束了！萨拉赫本赛季末离队，红箭三侠最后一人将告别</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250309124586.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250309124586.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250309124586.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">在马内、菲尔米诺之后，红箭三侠的最后一人也即将离开球队。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2dd09a42d3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">传奇！萨拉赫红军生涯：2次英超冠军、1次欧冠冠军、4次英超金靴</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.41" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251209/6937d227337dc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.41" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.41" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251209/6937d227337dc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251209/6937d227337dc.jpg"> </div><p>9年红军生涯，萨拉赫留下了满满的奖杯、荣誉，他的这一段旅途将在今夏画上句号。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2e8b75084cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不信谣不传谣！经纪人：不清楚萨拉赫未来去哪，其他人也一无所知</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251110/6910dcdfd6a1d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251110/6910dcdfd6a1d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251110/6910dcdfd6a1d.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">萨拉赫在社媒发布视频，宣布将在赛季末离队。其经纪人拉米・阿巴斯表示，萨拉赫将来会去哪支球队效力还未可知。</span></p><p>【格子将赴美职联】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c2993aa8bd5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">结束10年马竞生涯！官方：格列兹曼赛季末离开马竞，加盟奥兰多城</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603242214231522.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603242214231522.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260324/202603242214231522.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">官方消息，35岁法国球星格列兹曼将于赛季末离开马竞，加盟美职联奥兰多城，结束10年马竞生涯。</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">【其他新闻】</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c2b1c7578d0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">损失大将！BBC：埃泽将缺席阿森纳赛季关键期，可能伤缺一个月</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251109/690fad3fd4cb1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251109/690fad3fd4cb1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251109/690fad3fd4cb1.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">BBC独家消息，阿森纳攻击手埃泽可能将因伤缺战一个月时间。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2d2bedc4ccnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞官推炮轰vs皇马判罚：德比对面仅2次犯规？飞踢跳水都不吹？</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.83" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250230423553.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.83" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.83" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250230423553.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250230423553.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">马竞官方推特发布系列推文，针对此前马德里德比的裁判判罚提出强烈质疑，晒出多段比赛视频证据，指责多起对皇马有利的争议漏判。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-24/69c2aa5e59b04native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">真误诊了！皇马跟队确认：姆巴佩左膝受伤，皇马一开始却检查右膝</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251208/6936da7cee4f8.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251208/6936da7cee4f8.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251208/6936da7cee4f8.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">此前据RMC记者Daniel Riolo报道，皇马对姆巴佩膝盖伤势出现严重误诊，对此科贝电台的皇马跟队记者Miguel Ángel Díaz确认了该消息。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2cab5e438enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">隆戈：米兰努力签格雷茨卡但700万欧年薪+签字费太贵，枪手领先</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250119/678bd42041d26.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250119/678bd42041d26.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250119/678bd42041d26.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者隆戈报道，米兰将格雷茨卡视为他们夏季转会窗的关键目标，但球队在竞争中处于被动。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2f20d50ea5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">前皇马营养师：皇马一直在问免费版ChatGPT应该给球员用什么补剂</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.76" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250427435083.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.76" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.76" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250427435083.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250427435083.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">前皇马营养师伊齐亚尔・冈萨雷斯通过社媒透露，皇马工作人员一直在向免费版ChatGPT咨询，应该给球员服用哪些营养补剂。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2ccae09237native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">谁更好？邮报：曼联将接替胖虎的人选缩至3名 托纳利/安德森/沃顿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.84" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250148177979.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.84" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.84" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250148177979.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260325/202603250148177979.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">每日邮报消息，曼联已将今夏接替卡塞米罗的中场引援候选名单，缩减至三名球员。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-25/69c2e455284f3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">莫雷托：多特接近和施洛特贝克续约至2031年，新合同含解约金条款</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251019/68f400e28e57e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251019/68f400e28e57e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251019/68f400e28e57e.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);